<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-jungo</span></b> , nxi, nctum, 3, v.
			a. and n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To join together</i>, <i>join</i>,
				<i>unite</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextrae interjunctae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 30, 6</span></i>
			 (cf. interaptus): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interjunctus (equus) equis,</span>”
				<i>harnessed among</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 308</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To unyoke.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lassos equos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 67, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et quasi interjungo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 83, 6</span></i>
			; cf. B. infra.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to rest</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">medio die,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Tranq. 17, 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mart. 2, 6, 16</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
